.SH SYNOPSIS
.IP
.EX
#include \(dqserver.h\(dq

int observe_set_level(int level);
.EE
.SH DESCRIPTION
Changes the observability level for the current session.
The level controls which hooks are active and what events are emitted on
\f[CR]CHAN_OBSERVE\f[R] (channel 3).
.PP
The requested level is clamped to the range [0,
\f[CR]OBSERVE_LEVEL_MAX\f[R]].
.PP
\f[B]Level transitions:\f[R]
.PP
